; Part of millgui. MIT licence, see millgui/LICENSE.
; One measurement on the tool setter: o<millgui_setter_touch> call
; [radius]. The setter sits at the G30 position (#5181..#5183, machine
; coordinates). With diameter offset mode #3012 = 1 the spindle centre is
; moved [radius] off the setter centre in direction #3013 (0 X-, 1 X+,
; 2 Y-, 3 Y+), so that a cutter's or the nose's rim, not its centre, lands
; on the setter; with #3012 = 0 [radius] is ignored.
;   1. Tool length offset off (G49). Machine Z 0 at #3006, then machine
;      X/Y to the touch point, then down to the G30 Z.
;   2. Probe down at most #3007 at #3004 (no contact aborts); go to #3009
;      above the contact. If #3005 > 0: probe down at most 2 x #3009 at
;      #3005 (no contact aborts) and go to #3009 above that contact.
;   3. Back up to machine Z 0.
; Returns the machine Z at which the setter tripped, computed from the
; G30 Z and the probed travel below it (so it does not depend on the work
; offset), and leaves the trip Z in program coordinates (with G49) in
; #<_millgui_setter_trip>. Leaves G49 and G90 in effect: callers run it
; under M73 and restore or apply the tool offset themselves.
o<millgui_setter_touch> sub
#<radius> = #1
#<dx> = 0
#<dy> = 0
o100 if [#3012 EQ 1]
    #<dx> = [#<radius> * [[#3013 EQ 1] - [#3013 EQ 0]]]
    #<dy> = [#<radius> * [[#3013 EQ 3] - [#3013 EQ 2]]]
o100 endif
G90 G94 G49
G53 G1 Z0 F#3006
G53 G1 X[#5181 + #<dx>] Y[#5182 + #<dy>] F#3006
G53 G1 Z#5183 F#3006
#<z_start> = #5422

G91 G38.3 Z[0 - #3007] F#3004
o200 if [#5070 EQ 0]
    (ABORT, The tool setter did not trip within the setter max Z travel)
o200 endif
#<trip> = #5063
G90 G1 Z[#<trip> + #3009] F#3006
o210 if [#3005 GT 0]
    G91 G38.3 Z[0 - 2 * #3009] F#3005
    o220 if [#5070 EQ 0]
        (ABORT, The tool setter did not trip on the slow touch)
    o220 endif
    #<trip> = #5063
    G90 G1 Z[#<trip> + #3009] F#3006
o210 endif
G90
#<_millgui_setter_trip> = #<trip>
#<machine_trip> = [#5183 + #<trip> - #<z_start>]
G53 G1 Z0 F#3006
o<millgui_setter_touch> endsub [#<machine_trip>]
M2
